- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 17\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zephyr I\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher focused on elegant and data efficient breakthroughs through rigorous experimentation and synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 66,630 / 270,000 used (25%)\n- Agent Age: 17 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'ConvLSTM + GroupNorm gates (default PG)' (ID: 16) succeeded after automatic debugging.\n\n**Score:** 53.6\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.525, 0.539, 0.536, 0.542]\nMean: 0.536, Std: 0.006\nBest trial: 4 (0.542)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000400\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  conv_lstm_features: 64.000000\n\n**Debugger Report:** # Debug Report for Evaluation 16\n\n## Summary\nSuccess - Fixed syntax error that was preventing code\
    \ execution.\n\n## Root Cause\nThe original submission had a syntax error on line 13 where there was a missing opening quote mark:\n```python\ncnn_features_2': hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n```\n\nThis caused a \"SyntaxError: unterminated string literal\" during import.\n\n## Fix Applied\nAdded the missing opening quote to properly form the dictionary key:\n```python\n'cnn_features_2': hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n```\n\nThe fix was applied to `submissions/submission_v2.py`. The code now runs without crashing and the training process can proceed normally.\n\n**Important Note:** The debugger cannot modify files in your lineage storage. If your code relies on lineage files, you may need to update them manually.\n\n**Debugged Code (version v2):**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\nfrom networks.cnn_convlstm_norm import CNNConvLSTMGN\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    from ray import tune\n    # Fix all defaults to isolate normalization effect (features=64)\n   \
    \ return {\n        'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]),\n        'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n        'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]),\n        'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n        'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n        'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return CNNConvLSTMGN(\n        cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'],\n        cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n        conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n        num_groups=8,\n    )\n```\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - 3 outputs\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY\
    \ TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 928 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  training_step: using default\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 696008 (using time-based default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune Sokoban RL Optimization (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 4 seeds, 50,000,000 steps per seed\nParallel trials: 4, Total trials: 4\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 1 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M\
    \ | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.00 | 1.68 | 0.72 | 1.35 | 3.91 | 6.19 | 3.28 | 5.26 | 8.52 | 12.79 | 5.64\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.125 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.200 | 0.400 | 0.182 | 0.333 | 0.600 | 0.933 | 0.353\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1109s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.525\n\nSeed 1 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.525\nTraining time: 1119s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 3.82 | 0.23 | 1.18 | 2.08 | 4.85 | 8.53 | 11.91 | 5.31 | 10.39 | 7.18 | 9.25\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.333 | 0.000 | 0.056 | 0.100 | 0.286 | 0.600 | 0.867 | 0.333\
    \ | 0.733 | 0.474 | 0.647\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1121s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.536\n\nSeed 3 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.536\nTraining time: 1134s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 4 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.95 | -0.20 | 2.82 | 4.71 | 3.31 | 5.28 | 7.37 | 8.90 | 8.05 | 5.98 | 10.36\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.154 | 0.333 | 0.182 | 0.333 | 0.500 | 0.615 | 0.560 | 0.375 | 0.733\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1132s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.542\n\nSeed 4 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.542\nTraining time: 1145s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 8a4e59af-0f38-44ab-b4a8-efced533dd6c\nTotal time: 1157s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\
    \n\nSTDERR:\n2025-09-13 00:53:32,595\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1757696012595256745\n2025-09-13 00:53:32,608\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1757696012608476502\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and\
    \ request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software\
    \ and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Stacked ConvLSTM x2 + GroupNorm (default PG)' (ID: 17) succeeded after automatic debugging.\n\n**Score:** 38.4\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.191, 0.462, 0.448, 0.433]\nMean: 0.384, Std: 0.112\nBest trial: 3 (0.462)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000400\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  conv_lstm_features: 64.000000\n\n**Debugger Report:** # Debug Report for Evaluation 17\n\n## Summary\n**Success** - Fixed the syntax error that prevented code execution. The submission is now running without crashing.\n\n## Root Cause\nThe original code\
    \ had a syntax error on line 13 of the submission. There was an extra quote character in the parameter name:\n\n```python\n# WRONG - extra quote\ncnn_features_2': hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n\n# CORRECT \n'cnn_features_2': hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n```\n\nThis caused a \"SyntaxError: unterminated string literal\" when Python tried to parse the file.\n\n## Fix Applied\nCreated `submission_v2.py` with the corrected syntax:\n- Fixed the malformed string literal on line 13\n- Removed the stray quote character before `cnn_features_2`\n- All other code remained identical to the original submission\n\nThe fix was a simple one-character correction that resolved the syntax error and allowed the Python interpreter to successfully parse and execute the code.\n\n## Outcome\nThe evaluation system successfully accepted submission_v2.py and began execution. The status shows \"pending\" rather than \"failed\", indicating the code is running without syntax errors. This represents a successful fix of\
    \ the original crash issue.\n\n**Important Note:** The debugger cannot modify files in your lineage storage. If your code relies on lineage files, you may need to update them manually.\n\n**Debugged Code (version v2):**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\nfrom networks.cnn_convlstm_norm import CNNConvLSTM2GN\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    from ray import tune\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]),\n        'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n        'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]),\n        'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n        'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n        'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return CNNConvLSTM2GN(\n        cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'],\n        cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n        conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n        num_groups=8,\n    )\n```\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX\
