- text: "LN-gated ConvLSTM + single-head attention is stable at 63.5. I’ll ablate ConvLSTM width to test capacity effects (48 vs 80 channels) under identical training.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"LN-gated ConvLSTM + Attn width ablation: 48 chans (default PG)\"\ntags: \"architecture, convlstm, layernorm, attention, width, policy gradient\"\nabstract: \"Width ablation for the SOTA LN-gated ConvLSTM with single-head attention pooling under default PG. Sets ConvLSTM channels to 48 to test capacity sensitivity.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\n  from networks.cnn_convlstm_layernorm import CNNConvLSTMLN_Attn\n  from ray import tune\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      # Fix all training hparams; set ConvLSTM width to 48\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]),\n          'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n          'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]),\n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n      \
    \    'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n          'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([48]),\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return CNNConvLSTMLN_Attn(\n          cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'],\n          cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n          conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n          attn_temp=1.0,\n      )\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"LN-gated ConvLSTM + Attn width ablation: 80 chans (default PG)\"\ntags: \"architecture, convlstm, layernorm, attention, width, policy gradient\"\nabstract: \"Width ablation for the SOTA LN-gated ConvLSTM with single-head attention pooling under default PG. Sets ConvLSTM channels to 80 to test capacity sensitivity.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\n  from networks.cnn_convlstm_layernorm import CNNConvLSTMLN_Attn\n  from ray import tune\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      # Fix all training hparams; set ConvLSTM width to 80\n   \
    \   return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]),\n          'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n          'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]),\n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n          'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([80]),\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return CNNConvLSTMLN_Attn(\n          cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'],\n          cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n          conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n          attn_temp=1.0,\n      )\n```"
