parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Replication: LN-gated ConvLSTM + 1-head Attention (64ch, default PG)\"\ntags: \"replication, convlstm, layernorm, attention, policy gradient\"\nabstract: \"Replicate the current SOTA configuration—LayerNorm-gated ConvLSTM (64 channels) with single-head attention pooling and default PG—to confirm stability of the 63.5 result.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\n  from networks.cnn_convlstm_layernorm import CNNConvLSTMLN_Attn\n  from ray import tune\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      # Exact SOTA configuration (capacity fixed)\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]),\n          'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n          'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]),\n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n          'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n\
    \      return CNNConvLSTMLN_Attn(\n          cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'],\n          cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n          conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n          attn_temp=1.0,\n      )\n```\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"CNN width ablation: 48/96 (LN-gated ConvLSTM + 1-head Attn, default PG)\"\ntags: \"architecture, cnn, convlstm, layernorm, attention, width\"\nabstract: \"Ablate CNN backbone width while keeping ConvLSTM (64 ch), LayerNorm gates, and single-head attention fixed. Tests whether increasing CNN channels to 48/96 improves planning.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\n  from networks.cnn_convlstm_layernorm import CNNConvLSTMLN_Attn\n  from ray import tune\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      # Only change CNN backbone width; keep everything else fixed\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]),\n          'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n        \
    \  'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]),\n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([48]),\n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([96]),\n          'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return CNNConvLSTMLN_Attn(\n          cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'],\n          cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n          conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n          attn_temp=1.0,\n      )\n```\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n/execute_action{reply 1}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 32 update:\n  - 2-head attention (ID 53): 58.7 — underperforms 1-head (63.5).\n  - LN+Attn with f_bias=0.25 (ID 52): 59.5 — also underperforms baseline.\n  Decision: retain 64ch, 1-head, no forget-bias, attn_temp=1.0 as baseline.\n  New submissions:\n  - Replication of SOTA config to confirm stability.\n  - CNN width ablation (48/96) with LN+Attn (ConvLSTM 64ch).\n  Next if both fail to beat 63.5:\n  - Lock in baseline and begin\
    \ drafting Archive paper once matured, with clear ablation narrative (LN>GN, attention helps, best width=64ch, temp=1.0, dilation marginal, FB/MHA regressions, PPO negative).\n```"
