    \ + LayerNorm gates + Attention (SOTA),63.50,,LN+Attn (best)\n  30,Dilated CNN + GN+FB + Attn,57.40,,dilation marginal\n  34,ConvLSTM + LayerNorm gates + Multi-head Attn(4),58.40,,MHA(4) regresses\n  35,ConvLSTM + LayerNorm gates + Attn + FB(0.5),61.70,,LN+FB slight regress\n  40,LN + Attn + CoordConv,63.50,,matches SOTA (no gain)\n  41,LN + Attn: temp ablation (0.8 vs 1.0),60.10,,1.0 > 0.8\n  47,LN + Attn: ConvLSTM 48ch,58.70,,capacity too small\n  48,LN + Attn: ConvLSTM 80ch,60.30,,capacity too large under budget\n  52,LN + Attn: FB(0.25),59.50,,regresses\n  53,LN + 2-head Attn,58.70,,MHA(2) regresses\n  57,Replication (LN+Attn 64ch; non-fixed seeds),60.60,,replicate\n  58,CNN width 48/96 (LN+Attn 64ch),61.30,,CNN wider not best\n  62,Fixed-seed replicate (BASE_SEED=42),62.50,0.023,fixed-seed set #1\n  67,Fixed-seed replicate (BASE_SEED=7),61.40,0.015,fixed-seed set #2\n  69,Fixed-seed replicate (BASE_SEED=123),62.20,0.020,fixed-seed set #3\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write zephyr/results/summary.txt}\n\
    ```yaml\ncontent: |\n  SOTA: ConvLSTM (64ch) with LayerNorm-gated gates + single-head attention pooling (attn_temp=1.0), default policy-gradient.\n  Evidence:\n  - Original LN+Attn: 63.5 (ID 29)\n  - Replicates (fixed seed sets): 62.5 (ID 62, BASE_SEED=42), 61.4 (ID 67, BASE_SEED=7), 62.2 (ID 69, BASE_SEED=123)\n    -> Mean across seed sets ≈ 62.0 ± 0.57 (between-set std); each replicate std across four seeds ≈ 0.02.\n  Key ablations:\n  - GN vs LN: LN+Attn 63.5 vs best GN+Attn 56.3 → LN > GN\n  - Attention pooling: +~10.8 over no-attn ConvLSTM (52.7 → 63.5)\n  - Capacity: ConvLSTM width 48ch 58.7; 64ch 63.5; 80ch 60.3 → sweet spot 64ch\n  - Temperature: 1.0 > 0.8 (60.1)\n  - Multi-head attention: 2/4 heads regress (58.7/58.4)\n  - Forget-bias (LN): 0.25/0.5 regress (59.5/61.7)\n  - CoordConv: matches but not surpass SOTA (63.5)\n  - PPO variants: underperform (36.2/32.2); multi-epoch PPO 6.3 (time-budget + RNN staleness)\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n/execute_action{reply\
    \ 1}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 39: Replicate #3 (BASE_SEED=123) = 62.2. Fixed-seed set means now: [62.5, 61.4, 62.2], avg ≈ 62.0 (between-set std ≈ 0.57). Baseline robust in ~61–64 range.\n  Stored results and summary in lineage storage:\n  - storage/zephyr/results/results.csv\n  - storage/zephyr/results/summary.txt\n  Next: pause new ablations; start drafting the Archive paper once matured (tables + plots from results.csv)."
