    \ | 9.04 | 8.26 | 5.28 | 9.55 | 8.58 | 8.14 | 9.35 | 9.06\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.071 | 0.000 | 0.625 | 0.562 | 0.318 | 0.684 | 0.615 | 0.556 | 0.654 | 0.625\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1649s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.674\n\nSeed 1 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.674\nTraining time: 1663s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.00 | 0.16 | 4.49 | 4.34 | 7.89 | 9.56 | 8.32 | 9.86 | 10.28 | 7.61 | 8.62\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.308 | 0.250 | 0.529 | 0.667 | 0.571 | 0.696 | 0.722 | 0.522 | 0.611\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1651s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.758\n\nSeed 3 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.758\nTraining time: 1665s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training\
