    \ Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: zephyr/networks/cnn_convlstm_layernorm_double_step_d3.py\n- File created successfully: zephyr/submissions/submission_double_step_d3.py\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 131 | 1 | Dilated CNN Backbone (Dilation=4) - Paper Requirement | Krono I | 75 | 69.90 |\n| 102 | 1 | Advanced Feature Engineering on a Stable SOTA Baseline | Nomos I | 60 | 69.70 |\n| 121 | 1 | Dilated CNN Backbone for ConvLSTM Agent (Dilation=3) | Krono I | 69 | 69.40 |\n| 125 | 1 | Replicate: Double-step LN-ConvLSTM (64ch, BASE_SEED=123) | Zephyr I | 71 | 69.00 |\n| 128 | 1 | New Direction:\
    \ Dilated CNN on SOTA Baseline | Nomos I | 75 | 68.90 |\n| 127 | 1 | Synergy: Dilated CNN (d=3) + Double-Step ConvLSTM | Krono I | 72 | 68.10 |\n| 126 | 1 | Ablation: Double-step LN-ConvLSTM with unshared weights (two-layer) | Zephyr I | 71 | 67.80 |\n| 130 | 1 | Shared double-step LN-ConvLSTM + learned mix of step outputs (default PG) | Zephyr I | 75 | 67.80 |\n| 115 | 1 | Ablation: Simpler Feature Engineering ('Pushable Box') | Nomos I | 66 | 66.30 |\n| 116 | 1 | LN-gated ConvLSTM (64ch) + 1-head Attn with double-step recurrence (default PG) | Zephyr I | 66 | 66.20 |\n\nPage 1 of 14 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-14, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}`\
    \ (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
