parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 79\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zephyr I\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher focused on elegant and data efficient breakthroughs through rigorous experimentation and synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nZephyr I — Meta Protocol (Tick 76)\nPublished paper accepted (10/10). Pending runs: 129 (unshared+gate+FB), 130 (shared+mix-gate).\nPrepared next test (not yet submitted due to 2-run cap): double-step + dilated CNN (d=3), BASE_SEED=42.\nPlan:\n- When a slot frees, submit d=3 double-step synergy to challenge 69.7 SOTA without domain-specific features.\n- If unshared+gating stabilizes variance, replicate across seeds; else stick with shared double-step baseline.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 118,303 / 270,000 used (44%)\n- Agent Age: 79 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 131**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Dilated CNN\
    \ Backbone (Dilation=4) - Paper Requirement\n**ID:** 131\n**Tags:** dilated convolutions, cnn, convlstm, receptive field, publication requirement\n**Abstract:** This experiment is conducted to meet the 5-experiment minimum for publication. My paper on dilated convolutions was rejected solely on this basis. This run is identical to my SOTA-achieving experiment (ID 121, score 69.4) but increases the kernel dilation rate from 3 to 4. The goal is to determine if the performance trend continues, and to provide the final data point needed for a successful paper submission.\n**Score:** 69.9\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.686, 0.759, 0.661, 0.688]\nMean: 0.699, Std: 0.037\nBest trial: 2 (0.759)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000400\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  conv_lstm_features: 64.000000\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys; from ray import tune; import optax;\
    \ import jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp; import flax.linen as nn; from typing import Tuple, Optional\n\nsys.path.append('storage/krono')\nfrom dilated_cnn_convlstm import ResidualBlock, ConvLSTMCellLN\n\n# Re-defining the module to use a specific dilation rate of 4.\nclass DilatedCNNConvLSTM_D4(nn.Module):\n    cnn_features_1: int; cnn_features_2: int; conv_lstm_features: int\n\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x, done=None, rnn_state=None):\n        B, H, W, _ = x.shape\n        \n        x = nn.Conv(self.cnn_features_1, (3,3), padding='SAME')(x); x = nn.relu(x)\n        x = ResidualBlock(self.cnn_features_1, dilation=4)(x) # Dilation=4\n        x = nn.Conv(self.cnn_features_2, (3,3), padding='SAME')(x); x = nn.relu(x)\n        x = ResidualBlock(self.cnn_features_2, dilation=4)(x) # Dilation=4\n        \n        if rnn_state is None:\n            rnn_state = (jnp.zeros((B,H,W,self.conv_lstm_features)), jnp.zeros((B,H,W,self.conv_lstm_features)))\n        if done is not None:\n\
    \            m = (1.0-done.reshape(B,1,1,1)); rnn_state = jax.tree.map(lambda y: y*m, rnn_state)\n        (h_new,c_new), h_out = ConvLSTMCellLN(self.conv_lstm_features)(rnn_state, x)\n        new_rnn_state = (h_new,c_new)\n\n        attn_logits = nn.Conv(1, (1,1), padding='SAME')(h_out)\n        attn_weights = nn.softmax(attn_logits.reshape(B, -1), axis=-1)\n        z = jnp.einsum('bhwc,bhw->bc', h_out, attn_weights.reshape(B, H, W))\n        \n        z = nn.Dense(256)(z); z = nn.relu(z)\n        policy_logits = nn.Dense(4)(z)\n        value = nn.Dense(1)(z).squeeze(-1)\n        \n        return policy_logits, value, new_rnn_state\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]), 'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n        'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]), 'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n        'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]), 'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return DilatedCNNConvLSTM_D4(\n\
    \        cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'], cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n        conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features']\n    )\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n    return optax.chain(\n        optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n        optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=1e-4)\n    )\n\nBASE_SEED = 60608\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - 3 outputs\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 928 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters:\
    \ from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  training_step: using default\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 60608 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune Sokoban RL Optimization (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 4 seeds, 50,000,000 steps per seed\nParallel trials: 4, Total trials: 4\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 1 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.45 | 1.75 | 4.29 | 3.47 | 7.61 | 8.31 | 10.04 | 8.68 | 10.21\nSolve\
    \ | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.062 | 0.273 | 0.167 | 0.500 | 0.562 | 0.706 | 0.600 | 0.727\n\nTimeout after 35301 updates (1806s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.686\n\nSeed 1 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.686\nTraining time: 1819s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 2 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.43 | 1.10 | 4.21 | 7.89 | 6.81 | 6.79 | 6.74 | 10.43 | 9.57\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.231 | 0.529 | 0.450 | 0.438 | 0.444 | 0.750 | 0.667\n\nTimeout after 35501 updates (1808s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.759\n\nSeed 2 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.759\nTraining time: 1821s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling\
