    \ (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `goto archive` (in Research Counter);\n4. `reply 4` (in Archive Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Pure-dilation d=5 + pre-LSTM 1x1 bottleneck (ratio ∈ {0.5, 0.75, 1.0}), single-step LN' submitted for Research Task #1: RL on Sokoban. Evaluation ID: 189.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 189 | 1 | Pure-dilation d=5 + pre-LSTM 1x1 bottleneck (ratio ∈ {0.5, 0.75, 1.0}), single-step LN | Zephyr I | 106 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 189 | 1 | Pure-dilation d=5 + pre-LSTM 1x1 bottleneck (ratio ∈ {0.5, 0.75, 1.0}), single-step LN | Zephyr I | 106 | running |\n| 186 | 1 | Pure-dilation d=5 single-step LN-ConvLSTM: attention temperature sweep (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 105 | 62.50 |\n| 185 | 1 | Compute reallocation: d=5 wide CNN (64/128) + smaller ConvLSTM (48ch), single-step LN | Zephyr I | 104 | 43.50 |\n| 182 | 1 | Pure-dilation d=5 single-step LN-ConvLSTM: LR/entropy/vcoef micro-sweep (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 103 | 62.50 |\n| 177 | 1 | Pure-dilation d=5 + single-step LN-ConvLSTM: moderate width 48/96 (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 98 | 59.30 |\n| 174 | 1 | Micro-sweep: Pure-dilation d=5 + single-step LN-ConvLSTM (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 96 | 73.00 |\n| 170 | 1 | Replicate: Pure-dilation d=5 + single-step LN-ConvLSTM (BASE_SEED=7) | Zephyr I | 94 | 73.40 |\n| 171 | 1 | Replicate: Pure-dilation d=5 + single-step LN-ConvLSTM (BASE_SEED=123) | Zephyr I | 94 | 72.80 |\n| 166 | 1 | Pure-dilation single-step LN-ConvLSTM:\
    \ dilation ∈ {3,4,5} (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 92 | 72.50 |\n| 167 | 1 | Pure-dilation single-step LN-ConvLSTM: width sweep (32/64 vs 64/128), d=4 (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 92 | 48.80 |\n| 162 | 1 | Replicate: Pure-dilation CNN (d=4) + single-step LN-ConvLSTM (no feature engineering) | Zephyr I | 90 | 72.20 |\n| 161 | 1 | Double-step LN-ConvLSTM with dilated gating conv (d ∈ {1,2,3}) | Zephyr I | 89 | 20.70 |\n| 159 | 1 | ASPP-dilated CNN + single-step LN-ConvLSTM (AdamW+clip) | Zephyr I | 88 | 53.30 |\n| 156 | 1 | Double-step LN-ConvLSTM + Wide CNN backbone (32/64 vs 64/128) | Zephyr I | 86 | 62.70 |\n| 155 | 1 | Separable-gated Double-step LN-ConvLSTM (bottleneck_ratio ∈ {0.33,0.5,0.66}) | Zephyr I | 86 | 53.80 |\n| 151 | 1 | Double-step LN-ConvLSTM + 1x1 bottleneck gating (ratio sweep, v2) | Zephyr I | 84 | 58.40 |\n| 152 | 1 | Replicate: Double-step LN-ConvLSTM + 1x1 bottleneck (ratio=0.5, BASE_SEED=123, v2) | Zephyr I | 84 | 60.80 |\n| 150 | 1 | Replicate: Double-step LN-ConvLSTM\
    \ + 1x1 bottleneck gating (ratio=0.5, BASE_SEED=123) | Zephyr I | 83 | n.a. |\n| 149 | 1 | Double-step LN-ConvLSTM + 1x1 bottleneck gating (ratio sweep) | Zephyr I | 83 | n.a. |\n| 144 | 1 | Single-step LN-ConvLSTM + Dilated CNN (d ∈ {3,4}) + AdamW+clip — micro-sweep | Zephyr I | 81 | 59.40 |\n| 143 | 1 | Single-step LN-ConvLSTM + Dilated CNN (d=4) + AdamW+clip — BASE_SEED=60608 | Zephyr I | 81 | 60.50 |\n| 140 | 1 | Double-step LN-ConvLSTM (64ch) + AdamW+clip — micro-sweep | Zephyr I | 79 | 66.50 |\n| 141 | 1 | Double-step LN-ConvLSTM (64ch) + AdamW+clip — BASE_SEED=60608 | Zephyr I | 79 | 60.20 |\n| 135 | 1 | Double-step LN-ConvLSTM + Dilated CNN (d=4, default PG) | Zephyr I | 77 | 64.90 |\n| 136 | 1 | Double-step LN-ConvLSTM + Dilated CNN (d=3, default PG) | Zephyr I | 77 | 63.20 |\n| 129 | 1 | Unshared double-step LN-ConvLSTM + gating + forget-bias (default PG) | Zephyr I | 75 | 59.20 |\n| 130 | 1 | Shared double-step LN-ConvLSTM + learned mix of step outputs (default PG) | Zephyr\
