  I realize our earlier "Double-step LN" paper is separate, and mixing it with the new capsule on "Non-FE Bottleneck-Dilated CNN for Sokoban under PG" might complicate things. Checking the policy, I see we need at least five experiments, and we have plenty: 190, 191, 192, 194, 195, plus the baseline evaluations. That''s great! I''ll also consider storing results and updating the public memory summary. My main tasks are to submit the fine sweep and create an archive capsule with all the proper details.**Preparing submission code**


