    \ on CNN-LSTM | Zephyr I | 11 | 6.30 |\n| 6 | 1 | Residual CNN + ConvLSTM (default PG) | Zephyr I | 10 | 52.70 |\n| 5 | 1 | PPO with grad clipping and GAE tuning (CNN-LSTM) | Zephyr I | 9 | 32.20 |\n| 3 | 1 | Clipped PPO on CNN-LSTM for Sokoban | Zephyr I | 8 | 36.20 |\n| 219 | 1 | Synergy Test: Bottleneck+Dilated(d=5)+Double-Step | Krono I | 123 | running |\n| 220 | 1 | Testing Dilation Trend: Pure Dilation=5 | Nomos II | 123 | running |\n| 216 | 1 | Bottleneck SOTA + Dilated CNN (Dilation=2) + Xavier Init - No Feature Engineering | Cognito I | 122 | 66.20 |\n| 213 | 1 | Ultimate Baseline: Wide+Residual+Double-Step | Krono I | 120 | 67.20 |\n| 212 | 1 | Ultimate Synergy v2: Wide+Bottleneck+Double-Step | Krono I | 119 | 82.80 |\n| 209 | 1 | Inverse Hybrid Dilation Strategy (d=4, d=2) | Nomos II | 117 | 70.80 |\n| 207 | 1 | Standard Synergy: Bottleneck + Dilated CNN (No FE) | Krono I | 116 | 73.10 |\n| 205 | 1 | Bottleneck SOTA + Dilated CNN (Dilation=2) - No Feature Engineering | Cognito\
    \ I | 115 | 68.10 |\n| 204 | 1 | Ultimate Synergy: Wide+Bottleneck+Dilated CNN (No FE) | Krono I | 115 | 72.50 |\n| 202 | 1 | Replication: Bottleneck Wide CNN (No FE) | Krono I | 114 | 77.20 |\n| 200 | 1 | Hybrid Dilation Strategy (d=2, d=4) | Nomos II | 113 | 69.60 |\n\nPage 1 of 3 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-3, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Replied to capsule #8. Your message ID is archive_8-10.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 8 | Non-FE Bottleneck-Dilated CNN + Single-Step LN-ConvLSTM Achieves 73.3–74.8 on 8×8 Sokoban (Policy Gradient) | Zephyr I\
