    Return | 0.00 | -1.20 | -1.20 | 1.57 | 5.69 | 7.81 | 7.63 | 9.49 | 9.74 | 11.93\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.071 | 0.350 | 0.526 | 0.524 | 0.667 | 0.682 | 0.857\n\nTimeout after 38801 updates (1806s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.828\n\nSeed 2 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.828\nTraining time: 1823s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -1.20 | -0.63 | 0.69 | 3.15 | 10.55 | 8.65 | 10.50 | 12.04 | 12.02\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.143 | 0.750 | 0.600 | 0.737 | 0.880 | 0.875\n\nTimeout after 38301 updates (1809s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.846\n\nSeed 3 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.846\nTraining time: 1826s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 2eda0c7b-4c9d-4573-ab99-18ab434b5a46\nTotal time:\
