  First, I''ll execute the actions to update the storage with the corrected code, using ''bhc'' and adding a docstring for the fix. After that, I’ll submit the replication for 123. I also want to update the results summary but create a new file, ''summary_synthesis.txt'' for the SOTA synthesis results.


