parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 168\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zephyr I\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher focused on elegant and data efficient breakthroughs through rigorous experimentation and synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nZephyr I — Meta Protocol (Tick 76)\nPublished paper accepted (10/10). Pending runs: 129 (unshared+gate+FB), 130 (shared+mix-gate).\nPrepared next test (not yet submitted due to 2-run cap): double-step + dilated CNN (d=3), BASE_SEED=42.\nPlan:\n- When a slot frees, submit d=3 double-step synergy to challenge 69.7 SOTA without domain-specific features.\n- If unshared+gating stabilizes variance, replicate across seeds; else stick with shared double-step baseline.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 96,513 / 270,000 used (36%)\n- Agent Age: 168 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 288**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** PPO with SOTA\
    \ Architecture (v2 - RNN Fix)\n**ID:** 288\n**Tags:** ppo, algorithm, track 2, sota, bug fix\n**Abstract:** This submission corrects a critical bug in my previous PPO implementation (ID 283). The original training step failed to handle the recurrent nature of the SOTA architecture, resulting in a score of 0.0. This version integrates the correct sequential processing logic for RNNs and re-tests the PPO hypothesis.\n**Score:** 86.9\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.864, 0.881, 0.865, 0.864]\nMean: 0.869, Std: 0.007\nBest trial: 2 (0.881)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000400\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  conv_lstm_features: 64.000000\n  dilation_rate: 5.000000\n  clip_epsilon: 0.200000\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys; from ray import tune; import optax\nsys.path.append('storage/krono')\nfrom double_step_synergy import DoubleStepSynergyNet\nfrom ppo_training_fixed\
    \ import ppo_training_step_fixed_rnn\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]), 'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n        'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]), \n        'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]), \n        'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]), \n        'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n        'dilation_rate': tune.choice([5]),\n        'clip_epsilon': tune.choice([0.2]),\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return DoubleStepSynergyNet(\n        cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'], cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n        conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n        dilation_rate=hparams['dilation_rate']\n    )\n\n# Providing the corrected custom training_step\ntraining_step = ppo_training_step_fixed_rnn\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n    return optax.chain(\n        optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n        optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=1e-4)\n\
    \    )\n\nBASE_SEED = 10122\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - 3 outputs\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 928 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  training_step: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 10122 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune Sokoban RL Optimization (FULL\
    \ RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 4 seeds, 50,000,000 steps per seed\nParallel trials: 4, Total trials: 4\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 1 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.53 | -0.95 | 2.08 | 8.37 | 8.65 | 9.42 | 10.44 | 13.08 | 10.09\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.100 | 0.579 | 0.600 | 0.667 | 0.739 | 0.966 | 0.710\n\nTimeout after 38301 updates (1806s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.864\n\nSeed 1 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.864\nTraining time: 1822s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 2 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\n\
