    \ results at seed 42: clip=0.5 → 85.5 (ID 318), clip=2.0 → 84.6 (ID 319). No improvement vs 86.4–87.0 band.\n  - Submitted time-injection PG variant: remove time from CNN; append scalar time after pooling (files prepared previously). Will replicate across {7,123} only if ≥86.4 at seed 42.\n```"
