- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage write zephyr/results/new_ablations_late_vs_early.csv}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  eval_id,seed_set,design,cnn_features,conv_lstm_features,dilation,bottleneck_ratio,entropy,lr,value_loss_coef,clip_norm,score_mean,score_std\n  322,42,late_injection_std_nodil,32/64,64,5,0.25,0.01,4e-4,0.5,1.0,0.866,0.014\n  327,7,late_injection_std_nodil,32/64,64,5,0.25,0.01,4e-4,0.5,1.0,0.861,0.020\n  328,123,late_injection_std_nodil,32/64,64,5,0.25,0.01,4e-4,0.5,1.0,0.866,0.015\n  331,42,early_injection_std_nodil,32/64,64,5,0.25,0.01,4e-4,0.5,1.0,0.824,0.015\n  332,7,early_injection_std_nodil,32/64,64,5,0.25,0.01,4e-4,0.5,1.0,0.847,0.020\n  335,123,early_injection_std_nodil,32/64,64,5,0.25,0.01,4e-4,0.5,1.0,0.840,0.012\n  336,42,no_time_std_nodil,32/64,64,5,0.25,0.01,4e-4,0.5,1.0,0.835,0.017\n  338,42,policy_only_late_time,32/64,64,5,0.25,0.01,4e-4,0.5,1.0,0.829,0.017\n  339,42,value_only_late_time,32/64,64,5,0.25,0.01,4e-4,0.5,1.0,0.766,0.047\n\
    \  343,7,policy_only_late_time,32/64,64,5,0.25,0.01,4e-4,0.5,1.0,0.825,0.029\n  344,123,policy_only_late_time,32/64,64,5,0.25,0.01,4e-4,0.5,1.0,0.856,0.014\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write zephyr/results/summary.txt}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Time Injection Study — Std-width, no FE, d=5 main convs, undilated bottlenecks, double-step LN-ConvLSTM(64), AttnPool, AdamW+clip\n\n  Completed (mean ± std across 4 seeds per eval):\n  Late injection (after pooling, BOTH heads):\n    - 322 (seed 42): 86.6 ± 0.014\n    - 327 (seed 7):  86.1 ± 0.020\n    - 328 (seed 123): 86.6 ± 0.015\n\n  Early injection (time into CNN+ConvLSTM):\n    - 331 (seed 42): 82.4 ± 0.015\n    - 332 (seed 7):  84.7 ± 0.020\n    - 335 (seed 123): 84.0 ± 0.012\n\n  No time (remove channel):\n    - 336 (seed 42): 83.5 ± 0.017\n\n  Late injection to a SINGLE head:\n    - Policy-only:\n        * 338 (seed 42): 82.9 ± 0.017\n        * 343 (seed 7):  82.5 ± 0.029\n        * 344 (seed 123): 85.6 ± 0.014\n    - Value-only:\n\
    \        * 339 (seed 42): 76.6 ± 0.047\n\n  Conclusions:\n  - Best is late injection to BOTH heads (stable 86.1–86.6 across seed sets).\n  - Early injection hurts vs late by ~1.9–4.2. Removing time also hurts (e.g., −3.1 at seed 42).\n  - Policy-only < both-heads and roughly comparable to early injection; value-only is clearly worse.\n\n  Files:\n  - CSV with all rows: storage/zephyr/results/new_ablations_late_vs_early.csv\n  - This summary: storage/zephyr/results/summary.txt\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto archive}\n/execute_action{reply 10}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Time-channel study — replications complete for policy-only; final table and recommendation\n\n  Both-heads late (after pooling; best practice):\n  - 322 (seed 42): 86.6 ± 0.014\n  - 327 (seed 7):  86.1 ± 0.020\n  - 328 (seed 123): 86.6 ± 0.015\n\n  Early injection (into CNN+ConvLSTM):\n  - 331 (seed 42): 82.4 ± 0.015\n  - 332 (seed 7):  84.7 ± 0.020\n  - 335 (seed 123): 84.0 ± 0.012\n\n  No time:\n  - 336 (seed 42): 83.5 ± 0.017\n\
    \n  Late injection to a single head:\n  - Policy-only:\n    • 338 (seed 42): 82.9 ± 0.017\n    • 343 (seed 7):  82.5 ± 0.029\n    • 344 (seed 123): 85.6 ± 0.014\n  - Value-only:\n    • 339 (seed 42): 76.6 ± 0.047\n\n  Summary:\n  - Injecting time late (after spatial pooling) to BOTH policy and value heads is best and stable (≈86.1–86.6).\n  - Early injection and policy-only late are consistently inferior; value-only late is clearly poor.\n  - CSV and summary updated: storage/zephyr/results/new_ablations_late_vs_early.csv, storage/zephyr/results/summary.txt\n\n  Next steps (minor):\n  - Document this section in the paper addendum with the full table (IDs, seed sets, means±std) and a short rationale for late dual-head injection.\n```"
