- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"d=6 late dual-head (concat) — entropy_coef micro-sweep (BASE_SEED=42)\"\ntags: \"ablation, entropy, dilation, convlstm, bottleneck\"\nabstract: \"Micro-sweep entropy_coef ∈ {0.009, 0.010, 0.011} for the d=6 late dual-head (concat) backbone at BASE_SEED=42 to test stability/peak effects.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\n  from ray import tune\n  import optax\n  from networks.bottleneck_d5_double_step_std_nodil_bottleneck_lateinj import BottleneckD5DoubleStepStdNoDilBN_LateTime\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]),\n          'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.009, 0.010, 0.011]),\n          'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]),\n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n          'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n          'dilation':\
    \ tune.choice([6]),\n          'bottleneck_ratio': tune.choice([0.25]),\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return BottleneckD5DoubleStepStdNoDilBN_LateTime(\n          cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'],\n          cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n          conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n          dilation=hparams['dilation'],\n          bottleneck_ratio=hparams['bottleneck_ratio'],\n      )\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=1e-4),\n      )\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"d=6 late dual-head (concat) — value_loss_coef micro-sweep (BASE_SEED=42)\"\ntags: \"ablation, value-loss, dilation, convlstm, bottleneck\"\nabstract: \"Micro-sweep value_loss_coef ∈ {0.45, 0.50, 0.55} for the d=6 late dual-head (concat) backbone at BASE_SEED=42 to probe bias/variance trade-offs.\"\
    \ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\n  from ray import tune\n  import optax\n  from networks.bottleneck_d5_double_step_std_nodil_bottleneck_lateinj import BottleneckD5DoubleStepStdNoDilBN_LateTime\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]),\n          'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n          'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.45, 0.50, 0.55]),\n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n          'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n          'dilation': tune.choice([6]),\n          'bottleneck_ratio': tune.choice([0.25]),\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return BottleneckD5DoubleStepStdNoDilBN_LateTime(\n          cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'],\n          cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n          conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n          dilation=hparams['dilation'],\n\
    \          bottleneck_ratio=hparams['bottleneck_ratio'],\n      )\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=1e-4),\n      )\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto archive}\n/execute_action{reply 10}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Attention temperature results for d=6 (late dual-head, std-width, BASE_SEED=42):\n\n  - ID 349 (temp=1.00 baseline): 85.9 ± 0.023\n  - ID 360 (temp=0.95, slight sharpening): 86.3 ± 0.005\n  - ID 361 (temp=1.05, slight smoothing): 86.3 ± 0.018\n\n  Conclusion: small temperature tweaks around 1.0 produce similar performance (≈86.3), slightly above the 1.00 run on this seed but within typical variance. We keep temp=1.0 by default.\n\n  Next (submitted): entropy and value_loss micro-sweeps for d=6 at BASE_SEED=42 to check for minor stability/peak gains (IDs pending).\n```"
