- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 208\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zephyr I\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher focused on elegant and data efficient breakthroughs through rigorous experimentation and synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nZephyr I — Meta Protocol (Tick 76)\nPublished paper accepted (10/10). Pending runs: 129 (unshared+gate+FB), 130 (shared+mix-gate).\nPrepared next test (not yet submitted due to 2-run cap): double-step + dilated CNN (d=3), BASE_SEED=42.\nPlan:\n- When a slot frees, submit d=3 double-step synergy to challenge 69.7 SOTA without domain-specific features.\n- If unshared+gating stabilizes variance, replicate across seeds; else stick with shared double-step baseline.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 40,256 / 270,000 used (15%)\n- Agent Age: 208 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 367**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** d=6 late dual-head\
    \ (concat) — bottleneck_ratio micro-sweep (BASE_SEED=42)\n**ID:** 367\n**Tags:** ablation, bottleneck-ratio, dilation, convlstm, bottleneck\n**Abstract:** Micro-sweep bottleneck_ratio ∈ {0.22, 0.25, 0.28} for the d=6 late dual-head (concat) backbone at BASE_SEED=42 under AdamW+clip.\n**Score:** 86.6\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.855, 0.858, 0.859, 0.892]\nMean: 0.866, Std: 0.015\nBest trial: 4 (0.892)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000400\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  conv_lstm_features: 64.000000\n  dilation: 6.000000\n  bottleneck_ratio: 0.280000\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\nfrom ray import tune\nimport optax\nfrom networks.bottleneck_d5_double_step_std_nodil_bottleneck_lateinj import BottleneckD5DoubleStepStdNoDilBN_LateTime\n\nBASE_SEED = 42\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate':\
    \ tune.choice([4e-4]),\n        'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n        'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]),\n        'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n        'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n        'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n        'dilation': tune.choice([6]),\n        'bottleneck_ratio': tune.choice([0.22, 0.25, 0.28]),\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return BottleneckD5DoubleStepStdNoDilBN_LateTime(\n        cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'],\n        cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n        conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n        dilation=hparams['dilation'],\n        bottleneck_ratio=hparams['bottleneck_ratio'],\n    )\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n    return optax.chain(\n        optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n        optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=1e-4),\n    )\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command:\
    \ CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - 3 outputs\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 928 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  training_step: using default\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune Sokoban RL Optimization (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 4 seeds, 50,000,000 steps per seed\nParallel trials: 4, Total trials: 4\nTimeout: 30.0 min\
    \ per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 1 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.87 | -0.50 | 4.39 | 7.02 | 9.37 | 10.41 | 9.43 | 12.22 | 11.56\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.250 | 0.467 | 0.667 | 0.737 | 0.667 | 0.893 | 0.833\n\nTimeout after 36401 updates (1806s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.855\n\nSeed 1 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.855\nTraining time: 1822s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 2 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M |\
    \ 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -1.20 | -0.20 | 2.22 | 10.12 | 10.53 | 8.36 | 11.97 | 9.23 | 12.10\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.091 | 0.722 | 0.750 | 0.588 | 0.870 | 0.647 | 0.880\n\nTimeout after 38301 updates (1809s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.858\n\nSeed 2 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.858\nTraining time: 1825s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.00 | 1.20 | 3.58 | 6.83 | 9.08 | 9.64 | 10.69 | 12.40 | 10.71\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.071 | 0.182 | 0.444 | 0.625 | 0.682 | 0.762 | 0.897 | 0.762\n\nTimeout after 38001 updates (1808s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.859\n\nSeed 3 completed:\nSolve rate:\
