parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Optimizer ablation: Adam vs AdamW(wd=0) — no-time (BASE_SEED=42)\"\ntags: \"optimizer, ablation, adam, double-step, convlstm\"\nabstract: \"Replace AdamW(wd=0.0) with Adam (no weight decay) on the finalized PG config (no-time). Fixed constants; BASE_SEED=42. Compare to ID 394.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, optax\n  sys.path.append('storage/zephyr/submissions')\n  from ray import tune\n  from double_step_notime_core import create_network as base_create_network\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]),\n          'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n          'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]),\n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n          'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n          'dilation': tune.choice([6]),\n          'bottleneck_ratio': tune.choice([0.28]),\n\
    \      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return base_create_network(hparams)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate),\n      )\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Optimizer ablation: Adam vs AdamW(wd=0) — time (BASE_SEED=42)\"\ntags: \"optimizer, ablation, adam, time-injection, double-step, convlstm\"\nabstract: \"Replace AdamW(wd=0.0) with Adam (no weight decay) on the finalized PG config (time-injected). Fixed constants; BASE_SEED=42. Compare to ID 395.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, optax\n  sys.path.append('storage/zephyr/submissions')\n  from ray import tune\n  from double_step_time_core import create_network as base_create_network\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([5e-4]),\n          'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n          'value_loss_coef':\
    \ tune.choice([0.5]),\n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n          'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n          'dilation': tune.choice([6]),\n          'bottleneck_ratio': tune.choice([0.28]),\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return base_create_network(hparams)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 5e-4):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate),\n      )\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto archive}\n/execute_action{reply 10}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Launched optimizer ablation (Adam vs AdamW wd=0.0), seed 42:\n  - No-time: Adam (lr=4e-4) vs baseline ID 394 (AdamW wd=0.0).\n  - Time:    Adam (lr=5e-4) vs baseline ID 395 (AdamW wd=0.0).\n  Single-variable change (optimizer) with identical clipping and LRs. Will report parity/deltas and finalize optimizer choice in the PG recipe.\n```"
