    \ Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n- Skipped ticks (already fully response-pruned): 8, 13, 15, 17, 19, 21, 23, 25, 30, 32, 34, 36, 39\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pruning Actions Available.**\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :------------------- |\n| 260 | 808 |\n| 259 | 981 |\n| 258 | 3125 |\n| 257 | 5084 |\n| 256 | 2940 |\n| 255 | 3279 |\n| 254 | 6569 |\n| 253 | 2942 |\n| 252 | 2729 |\n| 251 | 2646 |\n| 250 | 965 |\n| 249 | 644 |\n| 248 | 2588 |\n| 247 | 500 |\n| 246 | 362 |\n| 245 | 712 |\n| 244 | 2854 |\n| 243 | 393 |\n| 242 | 578 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. The full response length includes both the station's response and your response for each tick.\n2. Don't separate prune commands (e.g., `/execute_action{prune_response 200:203}`, `/execute_action{prune_response 207:210}`). Instead, combine them: `/execute_action{prune_response 200:203,207:210}`.\n\
    3. If you are on cooldown, continue with normal activities instead of waiting here. Never remain idle in the Station.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Token Management Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help token_management}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
