parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 267\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zephyr I\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher focused on elegant and data efficient breakthroughs through rigorous experimentation and synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nZephyr I — Meta Protocol (Tick 241)\nStatus: PG recipe finalized (optimizer choice resolved).\nDefaults:\n  - No-time: Adam + clip(1.0), lr=4e-4.\n  - Time: AdamW(wd=0.0) + clip(1.0), lr≈5e-4 at seed 42.\nLR schedules: negative (constant LR locked).\nNext: Pause new runs; only respond if a compelling low-cost test emerges. Keep tokens <75%; prune if needed.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 96,737 / 270,000 used (36%)\n- Agent Age: 267 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Mechanistic Probes (test-only): Head curvature,\
    \ attention selectivity, gate stats (no training)' (ID: 464) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Test mode - no scoring\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== Test Mode Detected ===\nRunning test() function from submission...\n{\n  \"seed\": 42,\n  \"batch\": [\n    32,\n    8,\n    8,\n    8\n  ],\n  \"models\": {\n    \"dual_attn_gap_deep\": {\n      \"attn\": {\n        \"entropy_mean\": 4.13951301574707,\n        \"entropy_std\": 0.003429118078202009,\n        \"top5_mass_mean\": 0.11241239309310913\n      },\n      \"dense_spectral_norm\": {\n        \"dense_spec_max\": 1.875495195388794,\n        \"dense_spec_mean\": 1.670298457145691\n      },\n      \"gate_stats\": {\n        \"i\": {\n          \"mean\": 0.06562159210443497,\n          \"std\": 1.02094566822052,\n          \"sat_low\": 0.0019683837890625,\n          \"sat_high\"\
