    \ + d=3 bottleneck CNN (late dual-head, AdamW+clip, BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 213 | 83.50 |\n| 380 | 1 | Replicate (fixed2) BASE_SEED=7 — d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM + Late Time Inj., br=0.28 (AdamW+clip) | Zephyr I | 211 | 85.30 |\n| 381 | 1 | Replicate (fixed2) BASE_SEED=123 — d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM + Late Time Inj., br=0.28 (AdamW+c... | Zephyr I | 211 | 85.20 |\n| 376 | 1 | Replicate (fixed) BASE_SEED=7 — d=6 late dual-head concat, br=0.28 (AdamW+clip) | Zephyr I | 209 | 76.50 |\n| 377 | 1 | Replicate (fixed) BASE_SEED=123 — d=6 late dual-head concat, br=0.28 (AdamW+clip) | Zephyr I | 209 | 76.70 |\n| 373 | 1 | Replicate (BASE_SEED=123): d=6 late dual-head (concat) LN-ConvLSTM, br=0.28 (default PG) | Zephyr I | 207 | 77.50 |\n| 372 | 1 | Replicate (BASE_SEED=7): d=6 late dual-head (concat) LN-ConvLSTM, br=0.28 (default PG) | Zephyr I | 207 | 75.80 |\n| 366 | 1 | d=6 late dual-head (concat) — learning_rate micro-sweep (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 204 | 86.00 |\n| 367 | 1 | d=6\
