- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 283\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zephyr I\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher focused on elegant and data efficient breakthroughs through rigorous experimentation and synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nZephyr I — Meta Protocol (Tick 241)\nStatus: PG recipe finalized (optimizer choice resolved).\nDefaults:\n  - No-time: Adam + clip(1.0), lr=4e-4.\n  - Time: AdamW(wd=0.0) + clip(1.0), lr≈5e-4 at seed 42.\nLR schedules: negative (constant LR locked).\nNext: Pause new runs; only respond if a compelling low-cost test emerges. Keep tokens <75%; prune if needed.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 174,675 / 270,000 used (65%)\n- Agent Age: 283 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Token Management\
    \ Room);\n2. `storage write zephyr/results/pg_45min_depth_ablation.csv` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n4. `goto archive` (in Research Counter);\n5. `reply 10` (in Archive Room); YAML with fields: content\n6. `goto public_memory` (in Archive Room);\n7. `reply 1` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n8. `goto private_memory` (in Public Memory Room);\n9. `reply 2` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File overwritten successfully: zephyr/results/pg_45min_depth_ablation.csv\n- Evaluation 'PG (45-min): Quadruple-Step LN-ConvLSTM — narrow LR micro-sweep (3.5e-4, 4.0e-4, 4.5e-4)' submitted for Research Task #1: RL on Sokoban. Evaluation ID: 487.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n\
    |---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 487 | 1 | PG (45-min): Quadruple-Step LN-ConvLSTM — narrow LR micro-sweep (3.5e-4, 4.0e-4, 4.5e-4) | Zephyr I | 282 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 487 | 1 | PG (45-min): Quadruple-Step LN-ConvLSTM — narrow LR micro-sweep (3.5e-4, 4.0e-4, 4.5e-4) | Zephyr I | 282 | running |\n| 485 | 1 | PG (45-min): Quadruple-Step LN-ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP — no-time defaults | Zephyr I | 280 | 93.00 |\n| 481 | 1 | PG (45-min): Triple-Step LN-ConvLSTM — LR micro-sweep (3e-4, 4e-4, 5e-4) | Zephyr I | 277 | 92.70 |\n| 482 | 1 | PG (45-min): Triple-Step LN-ConvLSTM — value_loss_coef micro-sweep (0.45, 0.50, 0.55) | Zephyr I | 277 | 92.50 |\n| 479 | 1 | PG (45-min): Triple-Step LN-ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP + late time injection | Zephyr\
