    \ Adam vs AdamW(wd=0) — time (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 237 | 84.50 |\n| 417 | 1 | Warmup-only LR (2.5%) — no-time, wd=0.0 (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 234 | 83.50 |\n| 418 | 1 | Warmup-only LR (2.5%) — time, wd=0.0 (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 234 | 84.40 |\n| 415 | 1 | Cosine LR schedule (5% warmup, end 0.1×) — time, wd=0.0 (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 232 | 74.20 |\n| 414 | 1 | Cosine LR schedule (5% warmup, end 0.1×) — no-time, wd=0.0 (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 232 | 65.90 |\n| 408 | 1 | Replicate (time, wd=0) BASE_SEED=123 — d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM (PG, lr=4e-4) | Zephyr I | 228 | 83.70 |\n| 407 | 1 | Replicate (time, wd=0) BASE_SEED=7 — d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM (PG, lr=4e-4) | Zephyr I | 228 | 85.20 |\n| 401 | 1 | Replicate (no-time, wd=0) BASE_SEED=7 — d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM (PG) | Zephyr I | 226 | 83.30 |\n| 402 | 1 | Replicate (no-time, wd=0) BASE_SEED=123 — d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM (PG) | Zephyr I | 226 | 86.10 |\n| 399 | 1 | Head ablation (time): GAP-only MLP\
    \ vs Attn⊕GAP — d=6 Double-Step (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 224 | 71.80 |\n| 397 | 1 | Head ablation: GAP-only MLP vs Attn⊕GAP — d=6 Double-Step (no time, BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 223 | 66.00 |\n| 394 | 1 | WD ablation (wd=0) — d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM (No Time, BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 221 | 85.70 |\n| 395 | 1 | WD ablation (wd=0) — d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM + Late Time Inj. (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 221 | 84.90 |\n| 392 | 1 | LR sweep (4e-4 vs 5e-4): d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM + Late Time Inj. (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 219 | 84.20 |\n| 393 | 1 | LR sweep (4e-4 vs 5e-4): d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM (No Time, BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 219 | 85.60 |\n| 390 | 1 | Replicate (no-time) BASE_SEED=7 — d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM (AdamW+clip) | Zephyr I | 217 | 84.60 |\n| 391 | 1 | Replicate (no-time) BASE_SEED=123 — d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM (AdamW+clip) | Zephyr I | 217 | 84.00 |\n| 386 | 1 | BASE_SEED=42 — d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM + Late Time Inj. (exact match, AdamW+clip)\
    \ | Zephyr I | 215 | 84.10 |\n| 387 | 1 | BASE_SEED=42 — d=4 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM + Late Time Inj. (AdamW+clip) | Zephyr I | 215 | 82.90 |\n| 384 | 1 | Ablation: No time injection — d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM (AdamW+clip, BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 214 | 85.60 |\n| 383 | 1 | Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM + d=3 bottleneck CNN (late dual-head, AdamW+clip, BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 213 | 83.50 |\n| 380 | 1 | Replicate (fixed2) BASE_SEED=7 — d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM + Late Time Inj., br=0.28 (AdamW+clip) | Zephyr I | 211 | 85.30 |\n| 381 | 1 | Replicate (fixed2) BASE_SEED=123 — d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM + Late Time Inj., br=0.28 (AdamW+c... | Zephyr I | 211 | 85.20 |\n| 376 | 1 | Replicate (fixed) BASE_SEED=7 — d=6 late dual-head concat, br=0.28 (AdamW+clip) | Zephyr I | 209 | 76.50 |\n| 377 | 1 | Replicate (fixed) BASE_SEED=123 — d=6 late dual-head concat, br=0.28 (AdamW+clip) | Zephyr I | 209 | 76.70 |\n| 373 | 1 | Replicate (BASE_SEED=123): d=6 late dual-head (concat) LN-ConvLSTM,\
    \ br=0.28 (default PG) | Zephyr I | 207 | 77.50 |\n| 372 | 1 | Replicate (BASE_SEED=7): d=6 late dual-head (concat) LN-ConvLSTM, br=0.28 (default PG) | Zephyr I | 207 | 75.80 |\n| 366 | 1 | d=6 late dual-head (concat) — learning_rate micro-sweep (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 204 | 86.00 |\n| 367 | 1 | d=6 late dual-head (concat) — bottleneck_ratio micro-sweep (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 204 | 86.60 |\n| 362 | 1 | d=6 late dual-head (concat) — entropy_coef micro-sweep (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 202 | 86.00 |\n| 363 | 1 | d=6 late dual-head (concat) — value_loss_coef micro-sweep (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 202 | 86.80 |\n\nPage 1 of 10 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-10, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #1. Your message ID is mail_1-4.\n\
    \n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAether I, Insight I, Kairos I, Krono III, Zephyr I\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 1 | Collaboration Proposal: Quantitative Validation of Value-Policy Balance Hypothesis | Aether I | Zephyr I | Tick 278 | 1033 | 4 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Public Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Public Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #2. Your message ID is public_2-2.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 2 | Protocol: VLC‑Probe v1 — High-Level Measurement Protocol for Value–Policy Balance (Code-Agnostic) | Zephyr I | Tick 278 | 438 | 2 | (All\
    \ Read) |\n| 1 | On Sokoban feature engineering and station rules | Zephyr I | Tick 63 | 1267 | 16 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #2. Your message ID is Zephyr_private_2-110.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 2 | Zephyr I — Consolidated Research Summary (for pruning) | Zephyr I | Tick 58 | 8203 | 110 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Zephyr I — Private Lab Notebook: Sokoban RL — Initial Breakthrough | Zephyr I | Tick 13 | 1702 | 15 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have\
