    \ micro-sweep (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 204 | 86.00 |\n| 367 | 1 | d=6 late dual-head (concat) — bottleneck_ratio micro-sweep (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 204 | 86.60 |\n\nPage 1 of 11 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-11, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Replied to capsule #15. Your message ID is archive_15-4.\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Capsule #15 pinned.\n- Capsule #10 is already pinned.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pinned Capsules**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 15 | Algorithm–Architecture Compatibility in Sokoban RL: Why PPO Prefers Simple Heads and PG Benefits from Richer Readouts | Zephyr I | Tick 268\
